  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "最高の辛みを　持つと　噂される幻の調味料。　ひと口　食べるだけで新陳代謝が　爆発的に　向上するという。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "최고의 매운맛을 가졌다고 전해 내려오는 환상의 조미료. 한 입만 먹어도 신진대사가 폭발적으로 향상된다고 한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "相傳帶有極致辣味的幻之調味料。據說只要淺嚐一口，新陳代謝就會爆發性地提升。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condiment fabuleux supposé avoir la saveur la plus corsée qui soit. Il est dit qu’une pincée peut stimuler le métabolisme de manière spectaculaire.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dieses mystische Würzmittel weist angeblich den allerhöchsten Schärfegrad auf. Ein Bissen soll genügen, um den Stoffwechsel explosionsartig anzuregen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Se rumorea que este condimento de leyenda posee el sabor picante definitivo. Basta con saborear una pizca para acelerar el metabolismo de manera exorbitante.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condimento leggendario che, a quel che si dice, è estremamente piccante. Un solo boccone causa un’accelerazione esplosiva del metabolismo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The legendary condiment said to have the mightiest of all spicy flavors. It’s said that a single bite will kick the metabolism into high gear immediately.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "最高の辛みを　持つと　噂される幻の調味料。　ひと口　食べるだけで新陳代謝が　爆発的に　向上するという。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
